# Intentionally empty (must exist, content doesn't matter). Without this
# file, `npm pack`/`publish` falls back to treating .gitignore as its own
# exclusion list - which would silently drop docs/opencode-docs-reference/
# and deploy/models-dev-snapshot.json, both gitignored-but-git-tracked on
# purpose (see CLAUDE.md) and both things the offline target machine
# actually needs. scripts/publish-npm.sh's git-archive step already
# guarantees only git-tracked content reaches npm in the first place, so
# there's nothing left for this file to actually exclude.
